WEBVTT

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:17.020
I won't let Kiryu die!

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:19.480
Kiryu and I will defeat you!

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:22.450
Defeat me?

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:26.070
You and the grim reaper can't do anything!

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:30.430
Since he's the grim reaper, 
he can save this hellish town!

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:35.590
All right, Kiryu and Yusei!

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:38.720
Kiryu, we believe in you.

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:43.480
We believe that you'll save us and this town.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:47.350
Leave it to us.  We'll defeat him soon.

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:48.420
Yeah.

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:51.290
Stop messing around, you punks!

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:55.810
They believe that they're going to win.

00:00:55.810 --> 00:00:58.030
They're really going to save this town?

00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:00.960
Enough nonsense!

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:02.980
Lotten will win!

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:05.870
If you betray him, I'll 
send you to the wastelands!

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:40.080
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:45.620
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:50.090
Don't look back and keep going

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:55.930
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:01:56.090 --> 00:02:00.900
There's no need to fear

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:08.570
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:14.580
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:20.350
Streak to the infinite future

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:25.760
Dreams surpass their limits

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:33.870
And will lead you to a bright place

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:06.060
Satisfaction

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:14.800
My turn!

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:17.670
I send a monster card to 
the graveyard to Special

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:21.970
Summon the Tuner Monster Quickdraw 
Synchron from my hand!

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:26.350
When a Tuner Monster is on my field,

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:30.150
I can Special Summon Quillbolt 
Hedgehog from my graveyard!

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:34.560
Level 5 Quickdraw Synchron tunes 
Level 2 Quillbolt Hedgehog!

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:37.930
Our thoughts combine to 
call forth a new power!

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:39.090
Become the path that lights the way!

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:40.490
Synchro Summon!

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:43.280
Burn up, Nitro Warrior!

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:47.640
Nitro Warrior attacks Gatling 
Ogre that's in defense position!

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:49.520
Dynamite Knuckle!

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:58.780
Good!  That annoying monster is finally gone!

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:01.980
When Nitro Warrior destroys your monster...

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:04.200
...your other monster in 
defense position switches

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:07.180
to attack position, and 
Nitro Warrior can attack it!

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:08.930
Dynamite Impact!

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:17.270
Nitro Warrior attacks Ambush Token!

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.180
Dynamite Knuckle!

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:31.210
Next, Justice Bringer attacks Ambush 
Token that's in defense position!

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:32.960
Justice Slash!

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:40.720
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:44.880
With no set cards, you're out of bullets.  
You also don't have Gatling Ogre in your hand.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:46.650
Impressive, Yusei.

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:50.310
You instantly took Lotten 
down to 1300 life points.

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:51.470
You punks!

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:55.290
You won't be cocky for long!  My turn!

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:59.790
I activate the spell card Card 
of Burial Magic from my hand!

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:07.170
I remove three spell cards in my graveyard 
from play to draw two cards from my deck.

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:12.800
I tribute two Ambush Tokens to 
Tribute Summon Long Barrel Ogre!

00:05:18.780 --> 00:05:20.470
Long Barrel Ogre.

00:05:20.610 --> 00:05:22.970
That's another annoying monster.

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:27.280
Long Barrel Ogre's effect 
destroys your monster

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:30.060
in attack position with 
the most attack points...

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:34.670
...and you take damage equal to half 
the destroyed monster's attack points.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:40.940
Due to Infernity Zero's effect, you don't 
die even when you have 0 life points.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:44.150
But you get a Death Counter for 
every 500 points of damage you take.

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:49.470
When you have three Death Counters, 
even the grim reaper will die.

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:54.510
Long Barrel Ogre, shoot Infernity Archfiend!

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:57.180
Great Snipe!  First shot!

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:08.790
Infernity Archfiend has 1800 attack points.

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:10.750
Half is 900 points.

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:14.640
I'll open a second hole 
in your non-beating heart!

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:21.820
Kiryu!

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:33.140
If I give you one more 
Death Counter, you'll die!

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:37.100
I can use Long Barrel Ogre's 
effect twice per turn.

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:37.870
What?

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:43.340
I'll open a third hole and gouge 
out the grim reaper's heart!

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.040
Die, Kiryu!

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:47.440
Great Snipe!  Second shot!

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:51.150
I flip over my trap card Skill Twist!

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:55.320
What?

00:06:55.570 --> 00:06:56.280
Yusei!

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:03.900
Skill Twist redirects a monster's 
effect to a different monster!

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:06.860
Yusei...

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:10.670
I told you that I won't let you die.

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:15.880
But Yusei Fudo, you lost 1400 life points.

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:18.310
I don't care if you die first.

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:22.380
I set one card and end my turn.

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:27.520
There's no way we'll die before you!

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:28.940
My turn!

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:33.680
I activate the spell card 
Blaster Cartridge from my hand!

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:36.100
I send four cards in my 
deck to the graveyard.

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:45.780
That card is Infernity Doom 
Slinger, the grim reaper's envoy.

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:47.670
I draw one card.

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:52.900
The activated spell card Blaster 
Cartridge is placed on top of the deck.

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:55.440
When I draw this card, I 
send it to the graveyard.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:04.090
I'm going to draw the top card in my deck.

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:09.380
If it's a monster card, you 
take damage equal to the effect

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:13.070
damage that I received plus the 
effect damage that was negated.

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:16.000
If it's not a monster card, I take damage

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:19.360
equal to the effect damage 
that I received this turn.

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:25.530
If you decline to choose, you can't 
deal effect damage this turn.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:27.110
What will you do?

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:34.640
Infernity Doom Slinger's effect is like 
Russian roulette.  You risk life or death.

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:38.300
But if I know the identity of the bullet...

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:49.010
The top card in his deck isn't a 
monster card.  It's a spell card.

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:54.390
The moment he uses Doom Slinger, 
the grim reaper will die.

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:17.160
Kiryu, the key to this duel depends on 
whether we can defeat Long Barrel Ogre.

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:19.270
I know.

00:09:19.270 --> 00:09:22.670
I summon the Tuner Monster 
Infernity Randomizer.

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:28.920
Level 1 Infernity Randomizer tunes two Level

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:31.850
2 Infernity Beetles and 
Level 3 Infernity Beast.

00:09:32.270 --> 00:09:35.440
When the living and the dead merge at zero,

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:38.190
the evil dragon escapes 
from its eternal prison.

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:39.550
Synchro Summon!

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:42.520
Come, Infernity Doom Dragon!

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:44.990
Kiryu's ace monster is here!

00:09:44.990 --> 00:09:46.850
What's that monster?

00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:53.270
3000 attack points.

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:58.530
That's not enough to blast 
through Long Barrel Ogre.

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:03.220
Yeah, but my goal is for Long Barrel 
Ogre to accidentally fire its gun.

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:07.000
With Infernity Doom Dragon, when 
I have zero cards in my hand...

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:10.800
...one of your monsters is destroyed, and you

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:13.210
take damage equal to half 
that monster's attack points.

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:14.130
What?

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:17.380
Good!  This will destroy Long Barrel Ogre!

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:19.930
Infernity Death Press!

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:23.260
I flip over my trap card Metal Coat!

00:10:23.460 --> 00:10:29.840
It equips on to my monster, and the equipped 
monster can't be destroyed by card effects!

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:34.850
When Infernity Doom Dragon uses its 
effect, it can't attack that turn.

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:36.110
I end my turn.

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:41.850
I thought you were going to 
defeat Long Barrel Ogre and me!

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:46.560
Maybe I'm the grim reaper.

00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:48.550
I'm still here!

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:51.540
I'll defeat Long Barrel Ogre!

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:57.010
They're not giving up?

00:10:58.080 --> 00:10:59.120
My turn!

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:02.830
I summon the Tuner Monster Bri Synchron!

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:10.410
Level 4 Bri Synchron tunes 
Level 4 Justice Bringer!

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:14.390
The wishes come together 
to form a new shining star!

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:15.890
Become the path that lights the way!

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:17.740
Synchro Summon!

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:20.620
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:25.040
Since it was used as Stardust 
Dragon's Synchro Material

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:28.150
and sent to the graveyard, Bri 
Synchron's effect activates!

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:34.450
Stardust Dragon's effects are negated, but 
it gains 600 attack points until the End Phase!

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:35.290
What?

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:38.280
Now it has more attack points 
than Long Barrel Ogre!

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:41.590
Stardust Dragon attacks Long Barrel Ogre!

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:43.040
Shooting Sonic!

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:45.720
I won't let you!

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:49.600
By sending Metal Coat 
equipped on Long Barrel Ogre

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:52.350
to the graveyard, my monster 
isn't destroyed in battle!

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:56.560
But I activated this card!

00:11:56.560 --> 00:12:00.800
Due to the Continuous Trap 
Synchro Blast's effect, when a

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:04.870
Synchro Monster attacks, you take 
500 points of damage once per turn!

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:08.820
But Stardust Dragon's attack points 
return to their original points.

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:12.550
I end my turn.

00:12:13.680 --> 00:12:16.770
You failed to destroy Long Barrel Ogre again!

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:20.930
But your pulse is weakening.

00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:21.530
What?

00:12:21.530 --> 00:12:23.900
This battle can head in any direction.

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:33.300
Don't get cocky!

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:35.360
This duel is over!

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:37.790
Barbara...

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:42.040
Lotten, we chose who'd win 
and lose from the start!

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:46.870
You're breaking this town's 
most important dueling rule?

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.980
Lotten controls this town!

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:52.370
Lotten makes this town's rules!

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:56.850
So you're not allowed to win.

00:12:57.590 --> 00:12:58.660
Right?

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:02.240
Barbara...

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:05.480
Surrender!

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:08.330
You two will die together.

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:12.050
Don't you care what happens to these kids?

00:13:12.050 --> 00:13:13.960
Kiryu!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.320
Nico!  West!

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:18.690
C'mon!

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:22.110
Stop it!

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:23.230
Don't!

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:26.540
Kiryu, you have to keep battling!

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:30.970
You're not battling just for us!

00:13:30.980 --> 00:13:34.620
Weren't you going to show 
the people of this town?

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:37.970
You're not the grim reaper.

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:40.200
You're this town's savior!

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:45.770
What will you do?

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:51.890
We won't follow your orders anymore!

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:55.250
That's right!  We control our own destiny!

00:13:55.410 --> 00:14:00.110
So we'll bet on our hero Kiryu!

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:02.320
You guys...

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:06.170
I won't surrender.

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:07.930
Kiryu.

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:13.960
You guys...

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:22.940
Lotten!

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:24.170
Stop, Lotten!

00:14:24.350 --> 00:14:27.370
That's dirty!

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:28.770
And you call yourself a duelist?

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:30.750
I'm a realist.

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:32.490
You punk!

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:33.980
Lotten...

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:36.210
Barbara is right.

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:38.230
We chose who would win 
and lose from the start.

00:14:38.490 --> 00:14:40.930
You were dead from the start.

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:44.120
You're spirits that were killed in this town!

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.420
Adios.

00:14:54.630 --> 00:14:57.100
Crow the Bullet has arrived!

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:58.070
Crow!

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:03.060
Yusei, you were taking so long to 
come home that I came to pick you up!

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:10.480
Kiryu!

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:11.770
Nico!  West!

00:15:11.770 --> 00:15:12.960
Don't come any closer!

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:15.820
I won't vouch for their safety!

00:15:22.110 --> 00:15:25.890
Even though you're a lady, Jack 
Atlas won't allow you to be cruel!

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:26.870
Jack!

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:32.770
Yusei, this is what happens when you 
meet someone as cursed as Kiryu.

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:35.750
This is the best!

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:37.800
Team Satisfaction is back together!

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:44.490
Wow!  The legendary Team 
Satisfaction are together!

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:00.300
Damn!

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:10.260
Lotten!

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:11.810
Outta my way!

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:21.840
Nico and West, are you okay?

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:22.840
Yeah!

00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:24.080
Damn!

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:28.970
Kiryu, use my D-Wheel!

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:31.230
Finish this duel!

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:33.910
Defeat him in one turn!

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:36.740
Thanks, Yusei!

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:57.830
It's your turn.

00:16:57.840 --> 00:17:01.080
What are you talking about?

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:04.260
I won't let you disgrace dueling.

00:17:04.260 --> 00:17:06.130
I'll battle to the end.

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:07.820
That's how I live.

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:09.760
How lame.

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:12.740
If you win, I'll let you go.

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:14.880
I won't hand you over to Security.

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:17.640
Will you accept this bet?

00:17:20.460 --> 00:17:23.220
The top card in his deck is...

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:27.820
He'll definitely use Infernity Doom Slinger.

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:29.810
When he does, I win.

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:33.130
Fine.  I accept the challenge.

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:42.460
My turn!

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:45.370
I activate Long Barrel Ogre's effect.

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:47.610
Shoot Infernity Doom Dragon!

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:50.490
Great Snipe!  First shot!

00:17:55.520 --> 00:18:02.420
You lose 1500 life points, which is half of 
Infernity Doom Dragon's 3000 attack points.

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:06.770
In other words, the final Death 
Counter will stop your heart!

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:11.090
What?

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:20.930
I activated Infernity Doom Slinger and 
Infernity Climber's effects from the graveyard.

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:22.170
You know the deal.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:26.640
If the top card in my 
deck is a monster, I win.

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:29.460
If it's any other card, I lose.

00:18:29.590 --> 00:18:32.420
If you don't choose, you 
can't deal effect damage.

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:40.300
I honestly don't know how many 
monster cards I have left.

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:43.210
What will you do, Lotten?

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:56.180
Pull the trigger.

00:19:01.180 --> 00:19:02.850
Great Snipe!

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:05.970
It's the monster card Infernity Climber!

00:19:05.970 --> 00:19:08.630
What?  Impossible!

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:12.290
When I have no cards in my 
hand, Infernity Climber's

00:19:12.570 --> 00:19:16.760
effect return it from my graveyard 
to the top of my deck.

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:35.540
Grim reaper...

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:54.460
Now I'm satisfied.

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:10.300
Watch where you touching!

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:15.590
You're not going to arrest us?

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:18.070
We've make mistakes too.

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:21.460
There were no warrants for your arrest.

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:26.710
Besides, this town needs 
people to rebuild it.

00:20:36.110 --> 00:20:38.490
So you're going to stay, Kiryu.

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:44.980
Yes.  I want to live in this 
town with Nico and West.

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:47.200
Kiryu.

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:49.510
Yusei.

00:20:49.980 --> 00:20:53.110
If you didn't come, I would have...

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:54.640
Thank you.

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:57.420
Kiryu.

00:21:02.980 --> 00:21:07.340
I thought it would be nice 
to re-form Team Satisfaction.

00:21:07.340 --> 00:21:08.760
Whatever.

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:11.340
I've had enough of those crazy days.

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:14.630
But it was fun to get back 
together after a long time.

00:21:23.370 --> 00:21:25.510
Bye!

00:21:35.510 --> 00:21:42.120
Until I rebuild this town, 
I won't be satisfied.

00:22:08.140 --> 00:22:12.840
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:12.840 --> 00:22:17.850
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:18.120 --> 00:22:22.750
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:22.750 --> 00:22:27.760
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:27.960 --> 00:22:32.630
The cruel god tests us

00:22:32.930 --> 00:22:39.570
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:39.570 --> 00:22:43.440
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:43.440 --> 00:22:49.310
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:53.220
Bond is the proper word

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:59.190
As we fight, we understand each other

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:02.190
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:02.190 --> 00:23:04.430
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:04.430 --> 00:23:09.100
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:09.400 --> 00:23:11.970
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:11.970 --> 00:23:15.440
You want to party until the morning

00:23:15.440 --> 00:23:18.680
At our special place
